flowchart TD
  A[Run feed snapshot workflow] --> B[Collect canonical public feed items]
  B --> C[Write compact snapshot artifact]
  C --> D[Deploy snapshot to shared edge path]
  D --> E[Update feed fallback and cache metadata]
  E --> F{Fallback stale or invalid?}
  F -->|No| G[Serve current snapshot to clients]
  F -->|Yes| H[Expose alert and keep probing validation source]
  H --> I[Route to next successful snapshot run]
  G --> J[Return snapshot version and freshness state]
  I --> J
